demos/
workspace
docs/features/z-alba

# Agent memory retros — gitignored by default so per-agent retros stay local.
# Remove the line below (and keep the two exceptions) to opt into tracking retros in git.
memory/agents/*.md
!memory/agents/README.md
!memory/agents/TEMPLATE.md